 359:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/extra/layouts/grid/lv_grid.c ****     /*Calculate the grids absolute x and y coordinates.
 360:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/extra/layouts/grid/lv_grid.c ****      *It will be used as helper during item repositioning to avoid calculating this value for every
